[00:11.33] Everything reflects the darkness
[00:15.05] 
[00:24.04] 真っ暗な街の 表面を飾った
[00:29.35] 無数の窓明かり
[00:34.44] 蒼白い首に 重い鎖巻いて
[00:39.70] そのすべて 嘲笑った
[00:44.70] Everything reflects the darkness
[00:47.10] When it's inside of my hand
[00:49.67] Everything reflects the darkness
[00:53.47] Shadow is the light!!
